error[L0520]: the result of `greeter` keeps a borrow of a temporary
 --> check/returned_closure_keeps_temporary_returned.knv:5:12
  |
1 | (defn greeter (name)
  |                ---- the returned closure keeps this borrow of `name`
...
5 |   (greeter (str "ana")))
  |            ^^^^^^^^^^^ this temporary is dropped when the function returns, while the result still borrows it
  |
  = help: take the value as a parameter of the function that returns this result, so the caller keeps it alive
  = note: run `knave doc L0520` for an explanation
